BI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q76N32","text":"Involved in maintenance of centrosome cohesion, probably as part of a linker structure which prevents centrosome splitting (PubMed:18042621). Required for localization of CDK5RAP2 to the centrosome during interphase (PubMed:24554434, PubMed:25503564). Contributes to CROCC/rootletin filament formation (PubMed:30404835)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}